{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:7b9c9f83efd60eab","name":"Scarred","source":{"id":"source:reference-7b9c9f83efd60eab","title":"Scarred","revision":20761,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:27:52Z","sha256":"cd9aac3d712351cf6a49845d47c792ba965b60b1e4227e1711fd9b56316620f8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20761","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Scarred&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-7b9c9f83efd60eab","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You were physically scarred in some way, a visible reminder of a trauma that you experienced. Perhaps your face was disfigured when ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stormtroopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stormtroopers"}," raided your home searching for contraband, or perhaps you lost an eye when your ship came under attack from pirates on ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},". The event that left you scarred might have been a traumatic event that pushed you into your adventuring career, or it could merely be a badge of pride- or shame- from your former life.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Relevant Skills:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Treat Injury"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Treat_Injury","referenceId":"reference:f1b9875c2302ce61"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Enhancement:"]}," You have a visible scar in a prominent place on your body (such as your face, your neck, or your hand). When you make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"}," a creature, you always have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Favorable Circumstances"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Favorable_Circumstances"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
